# Local/test only. Set baseUrl, csrf and session cookie in your private HTTP client.
# Never commit real cookies, API tokens, customer text or provider IDs.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Readiness (authenticated Wasla session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/readiness

### Ticket cohort report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/reports?channel=whatsapp

### Retention dry run (does not delete)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/retention

### Register an account only after substituting the real asset ID/version
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/accounts
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"channel":"whatsapp","provider_id":"<PHONE_NUMBER_ID>","api_version":"<VERIFIED_VERSION>","label":"Test account"}

### Queue an INTERNAL note; no customer send
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/tickets/{{ticket_id}}/messages
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: {{unique_request_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1,"direction":"note","body":"Test internal note"}

### Retrieve evidence-based reply suggestions (does not send)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/tickets/{{ticket_id}}/suggestions
